title: "research-with-ai: Using AI Agents as Research Collaborators"
abstract: "A domain-agnostic skill and Claude Code plugin that encodes how to use AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex) as research collaborators: topic and prior work, decision rules, experiment and model design, reproducibility and fair comparison, training diagnosis, research operations and manuscript review. English and Korean editions."
